\caption{\noindent \textbf{Manipulation overview}:  A stereo pair is fed as input to SimNet, which produces OBBs. Grasp positions are produced from OBBs and are used by a classical planner to grasp the object~\cite{balasubramanian2012physical}. This grasping technique has been deployed on a fleet of home robots to perform manipulation in optically challenging scenarios. 
}
